					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: SQUARE VIDEO OSCILLATOR\n\nIn this example we are instancing the Square oscillator 256 times by sending a Linear with 256 float values to the phase offset inlet on the Square.\nThis is a nice way to demonstrate how the pulse width works, give it a little tweak and see how the image changes."
